GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_PostGoLiveSoakDurationBasis> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Position_PostGoLiveSoakDurationBasis> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Position_PostGoLiveSoakDurationBasis> ;
    narr:childCount "12"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "7197e2e5261482e8ab862a8aa0f16ad8ffe0fb2f" ;
    narr:narration """The position's basis was overturned within a week. It opened as a [two-week minimum soak defended on the Dockside exception curve](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_21), with the evidence base flagged as [one site, one season](narr:Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_21). At the ops-readiness review, [a demand for dates plus a commitment that a soak doesn't get shortened because a date slipped](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_28) was met with [an agreement to hold it](narr:Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_29). At the cutover review the author [retracted the two-week figure outright](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_3), having [re-analyzed the logs and found the nine-day flattening was an artifact of a retired weekly reconciliation job](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_5) — [nothing in the new platform runs on a weekly cycle](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_7). The revised basis is [one week: underlying exception rate flat by day four, plus three days of margin](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_9), formally [ratified on the record as superseding the earlier note](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20). The register throughout runs antithesis and formal — [tight, not safe](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_15). A later review comment adds an open governance gap: [the one-week soak should name who signs off the second site before it starts](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30).""" ;
    narr:reaction """The trajectory you saw still holds — retraction, re-analysis, ratified one-week soak — but a new review comment pulls an open question into the span: [who signs off the second site before it starts](narr:Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30). The old narration read as closed on the number; the governance gap means the position is settled on duration but not yet on ownership. The [tight, not safe](narr:Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_15) tension now has a concrete follow-up attached to it.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_21> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_28> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_2HalyardOpsReadiness20260915_29> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_13> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_14> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_15> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_5> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_7> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_9> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "I'll note that the exception curve is the only evidence we have for it. It's one site, one season." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_21> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "The reason the queue took nine days to flatten at Dockside is that the old reconciliation job ran weekly and every run threw a fresh batch of exceptions." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_5> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "One week. Strip the reconciliation cycles out of the Dockside curve and the underlying exception rate is flat by day four." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_9> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "the soak between sites is one week, not two, and my note from the eighth about two weeks should be read as superseded by this." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "the one-week soak should name who signs off the second site before it starts" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The correction is endorsed but priced: the old two weeks was cheap conservatism, the new one week is defensible with no slack in it." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_13> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_14> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The ratified one-week figure still lacks a named sign-off owner for the second site — an open governance gap raised after ratification." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_20260928_1_ReviewCommentTinaTeammemberB4B484EaE94D4912B80BD_h8c260252a0a9_30> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "The original two-week basis survives only as a superseded note, kept on the record rather than erased." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1HalyardWeekly20260908_21> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_4HalyardCutoverReview20260915_20> ] ;
    narr:writer "z-ai/glm-5.3-flash:nitro" .
